> d$cum_num <- cumsum(!duplicated(d$X))
> d
  t X cum_num
1 1 A       1
2 2 A       1
3 3 B       2
4 4 C       3
5 5 B       3
6 6 D       4
7 7 E       5

Jim Holtman
